    "title": "Silver Alert in Mesa canceled after 85-year-old man with dementia is found - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SERENA O'SULLIVAN ,\n8 hours ago PHOENIX — A Silver Alert for 85-year-old Ascencion Olea-Torres was canceled on Wednesday night, nearly 12 hours after the alert was issued. He was found safe and in good health around 7:39 p.m. on Wednesday. Ascencion Olea-Torres was last seen in the area of Alma School Road and Main... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
